msgid ""
"NepTrain 同时提供可组合的训练、MD、结构标注、采样命令和可恢复的主动学习 workflow。 手动步骤与自动流程使用相同的科学 Adapter 和执行 "
"target。"
msgstr ""
"NepTrain provides composable commands for training, MD, structure labeling, and "
"sampling, together with a resumable active-learning workflow. Standalone steps and "
"automated workflows use the same scientific adapters and execution targets."
